And forgot to add that this suggestion just changes phonology of certain 
phonemes if we consider V=VqV as one phoneme no matter what sound {q} 
denotes.
This can be reasonable if we take into account that many lerfu have several 
possible phonemic realisations each (most notably "th/h" for { ' }).


